# Local build artifacts for the SecurityAccess Seed & Key DLL.
# Source (.cpp/.h), build scripts, self-test, and the Python cross-check
# are tracked; the compiled binary and intermediate build outputs are not
# (build it locally with build_mingw.bat or build_msvc.bat - see README.md).
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
self_test.exe
